{"title":"The Moon","slug":"The_Moon","hero":{"file":"The_moon.webp","width":400,"height":327},"pageid":4031,"revid":22098,"timestamp":"2026-08-02T19:06:26Z","lastEditor":"Nyarah","categories":["Locations"],"infobox":null,"sections":[],"body":"<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: the moon\">the moon</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/The_moon.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p><b>the moon</b></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: moon spot just right of the waterfall\">moon spot just right of the waterfall</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Moon_spot.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p><b>moon</b> spot just right of the <b>waterfall</b></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: lightslate on the moon\">lightslate on the moon</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Lightslate_on_the_moon.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p><b>lightslate</b> on <b>the moon</b></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: the cloud which you may come across while ascending to the moon, just about half of the way to the moon\">the cloud which you may come across while ascending to the moon, just about half of the way to the moon</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: the cloud which you may come across while ascending to the moon, just about half of the way to the moon\">the cloud which you may come across while ascending to the moon, just about half of the way to the moon</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Cloud.png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p><b>the cloud</b> which you may come across while ascending to the <b>moon,</b> just about half of the way to the <b>moon</b></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The moon is a location added for <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Update_Log/\">April Fools 2025</a>. The moon is high in the sky above the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Bridge/\">Bridge</a> to <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Ferwater/\">Ferwater</a>. You can get to the moon with the help of a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Mysterious_Potion/\">Mysterious Potion</a> with a 1% (?) chance, or by continously going up with a helicopter or preferably, a plane. oreless <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lightslate/\">Lightslate</a> abundantly appears on the moon, and during Easter <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Eggs/\">Moon Eggs</a>. there's a mostly transparent cloud you may and most likely will come across while on your way to the moon, weirdly enough you can frequently find grass on the cloud. the moon can still be found (last checked 2026-08-02)\n</p><p>(updated by: quandale scrip 2026-04-25)\n</p><p>(updated by:)\n</p><p>(updated by:)\n</p><p>(updated by:)\n</p>"}
